{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackjack Roulette,\u00a0a rogue-like \u201cspin\u201d on two casino classics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/f79759dd89e6315acf7f0ecb159ab770.avif?t=1765408660\" width=616 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get as close to 21 without going over and see how you compare against a roulette wheel of hands to beat. If you keep winning, the wheel keeps spinning! After each round, the wheel gets bigger,\u00a0 and so does the Buy-In cost. If you can\u2019t afford the Buy-In at the start of a round, it\u2019s <strong>Game Over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/50cb2bf248b2de4c240d7149b977ceb8.avif?t=1765408660\" width=616 height=286 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, this casino will gladly sell you insurance. Insurance Policies offer various upgrades and abilities to help, but they\u2019ll cost you. One policy lets you win on ties <i>(for a small fee, of course)</i>. Another lets you overcharge your hand over 21 without busting, but will auto-play your next 5 hands automatically. Press your luck and take out the Pit Bosses in <strong>Blackjack Roulette</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930450/extras/15cd60700cf0027aab5cbc937d71115a.poster.avif?t=1765408660\" width=780 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item